### Test AI Chat with Tools

### 1. Test query_users tool
POST http://localhost:3000/ai/chat/tools
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "message": "Show me list of users in the system",
  "conversationHistory": []
}

###

